\frac{\partial\mathcal{L}}
{\partial(\partial_\mu\phi)}
\right]
-
\frac{\partial\mathcal{L}}{\partial\phi}
=0
}.$ 重复的 $\mu$ 对所有时空方向求和。不写成求和简记，同一个方程是 $\begin{aligned}&
\frac{\partial}{\partial t}
\left(\frac{\partial\mathcal{L}}{\partial\phi_t}\right)
+
\frac{\partial}{\partial x}
\left(\frac{\partial\mathcal{L}}{\partial\phi_x}\right)
+
\frac{\partial}{\partial y}
\left(\frac{\partial\mathcal{L}}{\partial\phi_y}\right)
\nonumber\\
&\hspace{3em}
+
\frac{\partial}{\partial z}
\left(\frac{\partial\mathcal{L}}{\partial\phi_z}\right)
-
\frac{\partial\mathcal{L}}{\partial\phi}
=0.
\end{aligned}$ 第一项是熟悉的粒子项。场论为每一个空间方向添加一个类似的项。最后一项， $-\partial\mathcal{L}/\partial\phi$，保持不变。

p.src:
Restoring a characteristic speed $c$, the simple scalar Lagrangian density is $\boxed{
\mathcal{L}
=
\frac12
\left[
\frac{1}{c^2}\phi_t^2
-\phi_x^2-\phi_y^2-\phi_z^2
\right]
-V(\phi)
}.$ For a relativistic field, $c$ is the speed of light. In a continuum model it could instead be the speed of sound, the speed of an elastic wave, or another characteristic propagation speed.

